From bacb784b0207c43ea610bb8da9c8beb15f9ba61b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 01:06:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): read status strip, ribbon tabs, window margin and
 drop hint from theme

Add window_margin, status_h, ribbon_tab_pad_x, ribbon_tab_gap, and
ribbon_tab_stroke tokens plus clamp::RADIUS_WINDOW and theme::status_h.
Wire shell::shell_layout, panes::ribbon_tabs, file_drop::paint_hint, and
Tokens::style() to read these tokens without changing default dark/light
pixels, split theme_files::names out for the 400-line cap, and add
pinning tests in theme_shell_metrics, ribbon_rows, and file_drop.

Fixes #2064
